WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.500
Ɗigo uku. Kafin safiya, gaskiya za ta
bayyana.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Mama ce da kanta ta dafa miki! Miyar
barkono ta musamman!

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Tun yaushe Mama ke dafa min abinci?

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Sha, 'yata. Yana da kyau ga ciki.

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.200
To maza.

6
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.500
Jira… mene ne wannan?

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.500
Yesu! Mama, me kika saka a cikin miyar
nan?!

8
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.500
Shafewa ce! Shafewa tana ɗan ɗaci!

9
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Ehn ehn! Matsala ta sauka!

10
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.200
Ya Allah!

11
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.500
Ada… ban ji daɗin wannan ba ko kaɗan.

12
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.200
Nuna min.

13
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.800
Mama, ke fara. Ke kika dafa.

14
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.500
A ranar na gane cewa… miyar ba ni kaɗai
aka yi wa ba.
